From 2961736a5abcfc6cc46cd23d0dd3409cf85185d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:17:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(shapes): reuse constant outline shapes of wall-mounted
 lights

CeilingLight, Panel, PanelSmall, Mini and MiniLight built six cuboids on
every outline query only to return one of them. The cuboids are
constants, so create them once as static fields and pass those to
Util.voxelShapeMaker. The selected shape is unchanged for every state.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
